cards.text:
The Move Action now costs 1 {lungs} for the rest of the game

Investigators may still gain {lungs} as part of their Final Action if they choose to Rest

{infinity}

Roll a D6 now and at the start of each round:

1–3: All Investigators lose 1 {lungs} and 1 {charge}. Losing {lungs} in this way does not incur {facedown-wound}

4–6: The Adversary may place {destroyed-door} (Destroyed Door) tokens on all Doors in a Zone on the main board. They may also flip 1 {destroyed-door} token on an otherwise empty space to the {false-door} (False Door) side. All Investigators currently in that Zone must flip 1 random {facedown-wound} face-up

{infinity}

Now and at the start of each round, each Investigator must roll their Sprint die. On a 3, they must flip a random {facedown-wound} face-up or gain a {facedown-wound} if they have no {facedown-wound}

This does not count as a Sprint Action, nor does it affect their movement or {lungs}

{infinity}
